Frozen offline check, test, revision-2 WO validation and explicit owned formatting checks exit 0; exact outputs are in verification.json. No shared/protected edits, workspace formatting, dependencies or unsafe code were introduced. All 51 symbol mappings and 11 assigned original-case records remain. No acceptance is claimed: coordinator shared repair, independent root review, exact protected audit and fresh-main checks remain required. Mixed renderer/native/UI/performance/release gates remain later.

